   "nonFoundational": "Fashionware, Internal Cyberware, and External Cyberware have no foundational piece, but a Character may still only implant 7 Option Slots worth of each category.",
   "default": "Unless otherwise marked, a cyberware option consumes 1 Option Slot in its foundation.",
   "_resolves": "This closes the previously-open question about foundation slot counts."
  },
  "armorNote": "One worn armor per location (head / body / shield). Track current SP separately from base SP so ablation works in play.",
  "stackingNote": "Benefits from multiple installations of the same cyberware do not stack unless stated."
